            "caption": "How it started",
            "heading": "A notes app full of ideas",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "body": "<p>In 2024 Jonas was posting three videos a week with ideas in a notes app, scripts in documents and sponsor emails in his inbox. A brand asked for a draft by Tuesday. He found the email on Thursday.</p><p>That weekend he built the first version of Creator OS in Notion. A friend with a cooking channel asked for a copy, then her friends did.</p>",
